        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| KubeRay
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| Kueue
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| KFTO
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| MR
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| TrustyAI
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| Feast
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| LlamaStack
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| MLflow
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| Spark
        GatherSH -->|spawns parallel| AIGateway
